#. module: partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk_related_parties
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk_related_parties/models/res_partner.py:0
msgid ""
"ORSF gates the ownership graph behind a signed-in session, and issues no API key for it.\n"
"\n"
"Set an ORSF account e-mail and password in Settings ▸ Contacts ▸ ORSF; the session is then obtained and refreshed automatically.\n"
"\n"
"If they are already set, the sign-in was refused — check them, and the server log for the reason."
msgstr ""
"ORSF zpřístupňuje graf vlastnictví jen po přihlášení a nevydává pro něj API klíč.\n"
"\n"
"Nastavte e-mail a heslo účtu ORSF v nabídce Nastavení ▸ Kontakty ▸ ORSF; relace se pak získává a obnovuje automaticky.\n"
"\n"
"Pokud jsou již nastaveny, přihlášení bylo odmítnuto – zkontrolujte je a důvod vyhledejte v logu serveru."

#. module: partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk_related_parties
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/partner_autocomplete_orsf_sk_related_parties/models/res_partner.py:0
msgid ""
"ORSF returned no graph for IČO %s. The session token may have expired, or "
"the rate limit was reached — the server log has the detail."
msgstr ""

